		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>A hunchbacked, ochre- skinned thing from the Outer Dark. Entire face except the mouth is obscured by a caul- like skin flap. Hive mind being, collective memories.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 23, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +4 (2d6) or 1 consume thoughts, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> N, <strong>LV</strong> 5</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Consume Thoughts</strong>. Eat the thoughts of a helpless or unconscious target. 1d4 INT and 1d4 WIS damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Hive Mind</strong>. All caulborn within far of each other share knowledge and senses.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
